<body>
    <h1>Account Deletion</h1>
    <p>
        Users can permanently delete their accounts directly from within the app. 
        To do this, navigate to: Settings → Account → Delete Account. 
        Once the deletion process is completed, all personal data, including profile information, messages, and any associated content, will be permanently removed from our servers. 
        This process cannot be undone.
    </p>
